# pubspec.lock IS committed for every package in this repo (p0.3): the
# dependency-audit CI gate scans the locked transitive graph, and pinned
# resolutions keep CI reproducible. Ignore stray locks elsewhere but keep ours.
pubspec.lock
!core/pubspec.lock
!app/pubspec.lock

